WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.8 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
HR and workplace policies

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Write the workplace policies your people need, checked against local employment law.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List what staff and volunteers each need.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark which policies the law requires; confirm locally.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep them short, owned and reviewed yearly.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: seven short policies, including trainees' contracts and early shifts, checked each November by an employment adviser.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a list of HR policies and their status.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
